znL6stbirte6/view?usp=sharing\n黒ストはぜひ、できれば脚を出して、ガーターリングを、首にも似たようなものやチョーカーをお願いします。\n詳細なデザインはお任せします、コンセプトだけ維持したまま新しいデザインで描き直していただいてもいいです。\nご検討よろしくお願いします。", "nc": 145, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@yakoucider/works/4", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 2886220, "client_id": 2829683, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/3dd772ae/uploads/origins/2f154b58-5855-4e5a-801b-92df6567428a?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=d38048aa377ef6d6a180eb0f7968f4e1", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/3dd772ae/uploads/origins/2f154b58-5855-4e5a-801b-92df6567428a?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=d38048aa377ef6d6a180eb0f7968f4e1, https://si.imgix.net/3dd772ae/uploads/origins/2f154b58-5855-4e5a-801b-92df6567428a?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=aefd5ae6cabfd90e38439a535d33bc0f 2x, https://si.imgix.net/3dd772ae/uploads/origins/2f154b58-5855-4e5a-801b-92df6567428a?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=4491a3c92e195fd3e1e7a7303e241d69 3x"}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/3dd772ae/uploads/origins/2f154b58-5855-4e5a-801b-92df6567428a?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=5af2a518c2210e893cf421aa7b80698f", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/3dd772ae/uploads/origins/2f154b58-5855-4e5a-801b-92df6567428a?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=5af2a518c2210e893cf421aa7b80698f, https://si.imgix.net/3dd772ae/uploads/origins/2f154b58-5855-4e5a-801b-92df6567428a?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=b67d568e1f28265f424150083ed97dda 2x, https://si.imgix.net/3dd772ae/uplo